WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.172
Own land or property, but live far away or struggle to visit it regularly?

00:00:06.292 --> 00:00:13.774
PROPERTY SCREEN provides scheduled, on-ground property screening for owners who cannot visit often.

00:00:13.894 --> 00:00:21.327
A representative visits your site on the agreed schedule and checks visible conditions around the property.

00:00:21.447 --> 00:00:30.993
We look for signs such as dumping, overgrowth, blocked access, disturbed boundary markers, and other noticeable changes.

00:00:31.113 --> 00:00:37.721
During the visit, we capture photographs and record clear observations from the site.

00:00:37.841 --> 00:00:45.391
You receive a visit update with photos, so you can understand what was seen without making the journey yourself.

00:00:45.511 --> 00:00:54.641
Choose a visit frequency that suits your property and your needs. PROPERTY SCREEN is periodic visual screening, not round-the-clock security, legal verification, land surveying, or a guarantee against encroachment or loss.

00:00:54.761 --> 00:01:09.192
When something needs attention, you can use the observations to decide your next steps with the appropriate professionals. PROPERTY SCREEN. Your Property Is Never Out of Sight. Request a screening today.
